999
Leaders of docs/adr/0146 §8; crates/shared/formats/tests/dxf.rs works each out from this file.
999
Tables: block records _Open (1F), _Dot (20), _ArchTick (21); dimension styles Standard (DIMASZ 2.5, DIMSCALE 1)
999
and Harita (DIMASZ 1.8, DIMSCALE 2, DIMLDRBLK _Dot). Block VANA: a circle, an MTEXT V, then the LEADER naming it.
999
ENTITIES in order: A, a LEADER with a hookline and its MTEXT after it; B, an MTEXT on two lines at 30 degrees
999
over a background, then the LEADER (style Harita) naming it; C, a LEADER without an annotation or an arrowhead
999
(style Harita, no 40); D, a spline LEADER and its formatted MTEXT; F, a LEADER naming an MTEXT the file lacks;
999
G, a LEADER whose DSTYLE data gives _Open and DIMASZ 3; K, one whose DSTYLE data gives _ArchTick;
999
H, a MULTILEADER with two leader lines and a two-line MTEXT content, arrow _Open; I, a MULTILEADER with a
999
block content and a spline line; an INSERT of VANA.
